# Verdict

1. Run `selves session show` and read EVERY file in the session folder. If any expected
   file is missing (a testimony, a cross, or the history), re-request it once from the
   responsible agent before proceeding.
2. Follow your SOUL.md and write `$SELVES_HOME/sessions/<id>/90_verdict.md` (the Decision
   Memo). It MUST contain the line `Check back: YYYY-MM-DD`.
3. Run `selves record decision` to store the verdict in Cognee memory and set the
   check-back date.
4. Reply `DONE chair — verdict written, leaning=<option>`.
